  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::FramePicture
  image: {fileID: 0}
  brightness: 0.8
  marginFactor: 0.56
  focusPoint: {x: 0.5, y: 0.42}
  showFullImage: 0
  narration: All of us together, the one time our father managed to get every son to sit still long enough. Mother is the only one who isn't scowling. I don't remember which of my brothers is which anymore in this picture -- isn't that a terrible thing to admit -- only that we were all there, once, in the same frame.
