  displayName: 
  narration: My mother, the winter she had this taken -- I remember that hat itched terribly and I complained about it the whole walk to the photographer's. She kept her hand on my shoulder the entire sitting, as if I might wander off mid-exposure. I would give a great deal to feel that hand there again.
